OL,3,GNEWSAMoment paedophile who travelled
OL,4,A200 miles to assault child tries to
OL,5,Aflee arrest
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis is the moment a fleeing paedophile
OL,8,Fcarrying a knife who sexually assaulted
OL,9,Fa child was arrested by police.
OL,11,FSamuel Hyde, 35, who was already banned
OL,12,Ffrom speaking to children under 16
OL,13,Fwithout supervision, travelled more
OL,14,Fthan 200 miles (320km) from Lancashire
OL,15,Fto south Wales to assault his victim.
OL,17,FThe girl, who had been receiving Hyde's
OL,18,Fmessages for a week, managed to escape
OL,19,Fand call for help.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
