OL,3,GNEWSAMoment paedophile who travelled
OL,4,A200 miles to assault child tries to
OL,5,Aflee arrest
OL,6,
OL,7,FHyde, from Lancashire, admitted
OL,8,Fassaulting a girl under 13 by touching
OL,9,Fon 30 June, engaging in sexual
OL,10,Fcommunication with a child, breaching a
OL,11,Fsexual harm prevention order and
OL,12,Fpossession of a knife in a public
OL,13,Fplace.
